      ]
    },
    "items/RecordBuild": {
      "comment": "the save record of one stack (world and character saves): count, slot, item id, durability, fuel, level, dye, perks, gem (docs/kiln/services/items.md, 'Item instances'). items.instances reads the same fields the same way. Server 26430253 0x72a9b0",
